  "description": "Just when her crush was about to express his feelings for her, our FL is warped away into the world of an unknown webnovel. Stuck as a noble lady with a suspicious suitor who wants her life, and a mystery savior who looks a little too familiar... Death-threats, protective MLs, and a dark secret that surrounds the FL's new life! I don't care anymore! Take me back home! \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
